  "version": 1,
  "name": "AMADA punch",
  "notes": "AMADA punch, based on FANUC with AMADA\u0027s own codes (Pavel 2026-10-12): T = tool \u002B punching, X / Y alone = a hit, G70 = move without a hit, G72 = pattern origin, G98 = reference point, C = tool angle; patterns G26 / G28 / G29 / G36 / G66 / G67 / G68 / G69 / G78 / G79 from AMADA\u0027s AMNC-F programming manual and the Metalix AMADA customization guide. Verified on PART-IS-DOWN.nc (cncKad) and the Romstar Vipros 255 .VNC files. Tool shapes: Tools page (Fill tools from NC).",
  "kind": "punch",
  "units": "inch",
